|desc=
Impose your tyranny on the minds of those who fear you. Your mindpower is increased by (7 * √ Talent Level) against foes who attempt to resist your fears.

When a foe gains a new fear, you have a 20–50% chance (maximum 60%, depending on Talent Level) to increase the duration of their heightened fear and one random existing fear effect by 1–4 turns, to a maximum of 8 turns. Each time you apply a fear, you gain 2 Mindpower and Physical power for 5 turns, stacking up to 7–20 times depending on Talent Level.

You gain 2 new fears:

*The Haunted effect causes each existing or new fear effect that the target suffers from to inflict {{ctmd|40|60}} mind damage.
*The Tormented effect causes (4 + Raw Talent Level <sup>0.7</sup>) apparitions (maximum 9) to manifest and attack the target, inflicting {{ctmd|40|60}} mind damage each before disappearing.

Fear effects improve with your Mindpower.
